    <unit id="::ResistanceDescription" name="::ResistanceDescription">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The armor either absorbs the amount indicated by the percentage OR the flat number, whichever will result in more damage being absorbed. Keep in mind that certain damages (such as poison or direct mind damage, completely ignore armor).

The number in the brackets is the percentage by which the damage that goes through the shield and the resistance is modified.</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
